#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:26
msgid ""
"The recorded Xinference-launched process did not inherit the custom operator paths "
"that were present in the working native vLLM environment."
msgstr ""
"Le processus lancé par Xinference consigné n'a pas hérité des chemins des opérateurs "
"personnalisés présents dans l'environnement vLLM natif fonctionnel."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst
msgid "Diagnosis"
msgstr "Diagnostic"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:27
msgid ""
"The missing custom GDN/Mamba operator environment caused a fallback to the built-in "
"CANN operator, which rejected the model's float32 state in this case."
msgstr ""
"L'absence de l'environnement des opérateurs GDN/Mamba personnalisés a entraîné un "
"repli sur l'opérateur CANN intégré, qui a rejeté l'état float32 du modèle dans ce "
"cas."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:29
msgid ""
"Check both ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH`` and the custom ``op_api/lib`` entry in "
"``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` before changing model precision."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez à la fois  ``ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH``  et l'entrée  ``op_api/lib``  "
"personnalisée dans  ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``  avant de modifier la précision du modèle."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:32
